# Build context for cmd/api/Dockerfile (and any other Dockerfile built from the repo root).
# Only the Go module is needed. Excluding the rest keeps secrets out of build layers, avoids sending
# hundreds of MB of web/node_modules to the daemon, and stops 'go build' inside the alpine image
# from trying (and failing) to read git metadata. cmd/api/.dockerignore is NOT read for a root context.
.git
.env
.env.*
web
**/node_modules
